  (text "doing execute cycle of extended arithmetic\n* in FETCH cycle if no memory operand\n* in EXEC cycle if has memory operand"
    (at 411.48 544.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1243c737-e92f-47ae-bdc6-067ddcb49f45)
  )
  (text "dviover clocked at every TP2\nbut we only care about the one during EXEC cycle of DVI\nit must be valid in time to block the PAUSE during TS3\n\nmyacstep2 was valid since just after FETCH TP1\nyreg (really MBUF) valid since just after EXEC TP1\n...so it has 3 clocks to soak through the comparators"
    (at 436.88 490.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 17382967-02ff-4cc5-bdae-1d2f7ab26a39)
  )
  (text "pause processor at beginning of TS3\n  while doing step 3\nresume when termination condition met"
    (at 71.12 641.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 23343904-3ed1-4e98-846f-b30f0cb58681)
  )
  (text "perform step 3 clocking while processor pausing at beginning of TS3\nshift registers (AC,MQ) clock on posedge s3clk\nJ5 jumper (@ CLOCK 10MHz):\n 1-2 : 100nS on; 100nS off (MUY 6.5uS)\n 3-4 : 200nS on; 200nS off (MUY 8.8uS)\n 5-6 : 300nS on; 300nS off (MUY 11.1uS)\n 7-8 : 400nS on; 400nS off (MUY 13.4uS)\n9-10 : add +100nS off time (MUY 6.5,8.8,11.1,13.4uS)"
    (at 39.37 563.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 239204e0-45f5-4d21-972c-9f81b3e12ad6)
  )
  (text "SHL,ASR,LSR" (at 449.58 595.63 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6ccada8a-b37e-4f47-b067-00e6fc3c33db)
  )
  (text "opcode clocked at TP1 during FETCH\n* extar = it is an extended arith opcode\n* memop = the opcode has memory operand"
    (at 284.48 643.89 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 984ecbf7-e88d-49a6-b42b-c3c1732e6000)
  )
  (text "myacstep2 = value to clock into MYAC at TP2\n  for non-memory ops (NOP,NMI), clocked at FETCH TP2\n  for memory ops (SCL,MUY,DVI,SHL,ASR,LSR), clocked at EXEC TP2\n\n'or' of the following:\n  extop<4> = 0 : MYAC (ACUM from step 1)\n  extop<5> = 1 : SCTR from prior instruction\n  extop<6> = 1 : MQUO from prior instruction\n\nmyac from step 1 valid from just after FETCH TP1\nmquo,sctr valid from previous instruction"
    (at 241.3 71.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a656278d-d062-4aaa-a8f7-99b3977140d5)
  )
  (text "has memory operand\nSCL,MUY,DVI,SHL,ASR,LSR" (at 419.1 567.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e01bf3a3-1ac2-40dd-8480-25a79bc8e6cd)
  )
  (text "dviover = (myac >= yreg)" (at 464.82 472.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e21ae668-16e6-4332-998b-0b7b45bba2d3)
  )

